  "source_observation_note": "The official NCBI GEO accession page and the downloaded official series matrix were checked. The retained series matrix was freshly retrieved from NCBI GEO FTP at 2026-09-21T13:35:09Z and matched SHA-256 ad40dc0c4ce2338a241c09d3cc116ae78484bbf3f37fe69474c82d36e5cc27f7. The GEO metadata records sex/gender as 'male and female' for yw samples and 'male' for per01 samples.",
