    "biological_unit_limitations": "The 24 GEO samples comprise different cell populations and backgrounds; sex metadata are retained verbatim but mixed male/female pools cannot be split into sex-specific replicates. Individual fly identity, fly-level replication, temperature and batch are not fully available. Only the l-PDF/yw series spans four ZT bins; two-point series remain insufficient for rhythm estimation. Any cosinor output is exploratory and formal inference is blocked pending an appropriate mixed model and design-level replicate information."
